% layout 'counter';
% title 'Counter.su';

<a href="/top100">Top-100</a><br/><br/>

Embed HTML-code to your web-site:<br/>
<br/>
<textarea cols="80" rows="6" readonly><%== html_escape include 'include/script' %></textarea>
<br/><br/>
Or: <br/>
<textarea cols="80" rows="1" readonly><script src="https://counter.su/script.js"></script></textarea>

<br/><br/>

Counter Example:<br/>
%== include 'include/script';
<br/>

Another style of Counter (centered): <br/>
<textarea cols="80" rows="6" readonly><%== html_escape include 'include/script', style => 'center' %></textarea>
<br/><br/>
Or: <br/>
<textarea cols="80" rows="1" readonly><script src="https://counter.su/script.js?style=center"></script></textarea>

<br/><br/>

Counter Example:<br/>
%== include 'include/script', style => 'center';
<br/>

